# =============================================================
# speech-models.manifest — ASR (speech-to-text) model SSOT
# =============================================================
# Engine: mlx-whisper (Apple Silicon). Not served by Ollama.
# Pull weights: lm pull-speech [repo]   -> ~/models/speech/<basename>/
# Transcribe:   lm asr <audio> [--model <id>]
#
# Fields: ROLE|MODEL_ID|HF_REPO|ENGINE
#   ROLE     : primary=default  alt=alternative  retired=to delete
#   MODEL_ID : short name for lm asr --model
#   HF_REPO  : Hugging Face / mlx-community repo (pulled via hf-mirror curl)
#   ENGINE   : mlx-whisper
# =============================================================

primary|whisper-large-v3-turbo|mlx-community/whisper-large-v3-turbo|mlx-whisper
